Sends Dredges in a radius of [2, 3, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] into a frenzy for [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] turns.

The frenzy will increase global speed by [30%, 36%, 40%, 43%, 45% (TL1-5; SP 100)], physical crit chance by [30%, 36%, 40%, 43%, 45% (TL1-5; SP 100)], and prevent death until [-30%, -36%, -40%, -43%, -45% (TL1-5; SP 100)] life.
